{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06368","headline":"送王昌龄 · 李颀","name":"送王昌龄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漕水东去远，送君多暮情。\n淹留野寺出，向背孤山明。\n前望数千里，中无蒲稗生。\n夕阳满舟檝，但爱微波清。\n举酒林月上，解衣沙鸟鸣。\n夜来莲花界，梦里金陵城。\n叹息此离别，悠悠江海行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}